{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.ofCalibration_E0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.ofCalibration_E0","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompoundBetaShellCalibration.lean#L65-L68","doc":"In a `ofCalibration` record the shell scale is definitionally the H² input. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.ofCalibration","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.ofCalibration","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompoundBetaShellCalibration.lean#L50-L63","doc":"**De-axiomatisation (bean `lqft`).** `E₀ = 𝔔_β` is not a free assumption:\nthe shell scale is *defined* to be the `H²` calibration input `𝔔_β` (the\nmanuscript's \"shell sector introduces no new calibration\"). `ofCalibration`\nbuilds the record from the three calibration values with `E0 := H2`, so\n`E0_eq` is `rfl` — the \"no fourth calibration\" property is structural, not\nposited. (The numerical value of `𝔔_β` itself is fixed by the β-decay\nQ-value compute; that is a producer-side fact, orthogonal to this identity.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.E0_mem_calibrations","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.E0_mem_calibrations","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompoundBetaShellCalibration.lean#L43-L46","doc":"The calibration set stays a triple `{H⁰, H¹, H²}`: `E₀` is a member of it\n(equal to `H²`), never a fourth element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.E0_is_H2_input","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.E0_is_H2_input","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompoundBetaShellCalibration.lean#L39-L41","doc":"**No new calibration:** the shell scale `E₀` coincides with the existing\n`H²` calibration `𝔔_β`; it is not an independent fourth input. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.E0_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.E0_eq","kind":"theorem","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompoundBetaShellCalibration.lean#L33-L33","doc":"`E₀ = 𝔔_β` — the shell scale *is* the `H²` input. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.E0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.E0","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompoundBetaShellCalibration.lean#L31-L31","doc":"The shell scale `E₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.H2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.H2","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompoundBetaShellCalibration.lean#L29-L29","doc":"`H²` calibration: the β-decay Q-value `𝔔_β`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.H1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.H1","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompoundBetaShellCalibration.lean#L27-L27","doc":"`H¹` calibration: the muon ratio `m_μ/m_e`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.H0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.H0","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompoundBetaShellCalibration.lean#L25-L25","doc":"`H⁰` calibration: electron mass `m_e`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration.mk","kind":"ctor","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompoundBetaShellCalibration.lean#L23-L23","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompoundBetaShellCalibration","kind":"structure","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompoundBetaShellCalibration.lean#L18-L33","doc":"The three-calibration data with the shell scale.\n\nA `definition` carrier: the three cohomological calibration inputs\n`H⁰ = m_e`, `H¹ = m_μ/m_e`, `H² = 𝔔_β`, and the shell scale `E₀`, pinned\nto `𝔔_β` (the `H²` input). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:compound-beta-shell-calibration","label":"prop:compound-beta-shell-calibration","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/compound-beta-shell-calibration.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}